1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,138
Friend Mode adds Offline Viewing:

2
00:00:03,175 --> 00:00:06,588
save movies and episodes to watch with no internet.

3
00:00:07,375 --> 00:00:09,812
You'll need a Friend key from the app's owner.

4
00:00:11,093 --> 00:00:11,943
On a TV,

5
00:00:11,943 --> 00:00:13,056
use your phone.

6
00:00:13,806 --> 00:00:15,606
Open Settings, then About.

7
00:00:16,343 --> 00:00:17,156
Right now,

8
00:00:17,156 --> 00:00:17,093
it's in User Mode.

9
00:00:17,093 --> 00:00:20,056
Scan the Easy Settings QR code with your phone.

10
00:00:22,043 --> 00:00:23,906
On your phone, open Access,

11
00:00:23,943 --> 00:00:25,818
type or paste your Friend key,

12
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:27,206
and tap Use Key.

13
00:00:32,021 --> 00:00:33,521
The TV checks the key,

14
00:00:33,633 --> 00:00:35,158
and Friend Mode is on.

15
00:00:35,908 --> 00:00:37,508
There's the new Friend badge.

16
00:00:41,703 --> 00:00:44,078
Or do it right on the TV: in About,

17
00:00:44,165 --> 00:00:46,003
open Designer, Developer.

18
00:00:47,988 --> 00:00:48,838
Choose It's Me!

19
00:00:52,388 --> 00:00:53,313
Enter your key,

20
00:00:53,363 --> 00:00:54,701
then choose Unlock.

21
00:00:59,628 --> 00:01:00,990
A few seconds later,

22
00:01:00,990 --> 00:01:02,490
Friend Mode is on.

23
00:01:03,928 --> 00:01:04,665
On a phone,

24
00:01:04,665 --> 00:01:05,590
it's the same.

25
00:01:06,353 --> 00:01:08,128
Go to Settings, then About.

26
00:01:08,128 --> 00:01:10,928
Scroll down and tap Designer, Developer.

27
00:01:12,488 --> 00:01:13,313
Tap It's Me!

28
00:01:16,857 --> 00:01:17,794
Enter your key,

29
00:01:17,844 --> 00:01:19,044
and tap Unlock.

30
00:01:23,590 --> 00:01:24,803
Friend Mode is on,

31
00:01:24,803 --> 00:01:26,140
with its Friend badge.

32
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:31,878
One thing to know:

33
00:01:31,903 --> 00:01:33,303
the mode isn't synced.

34
00:01:34,090 --> 00:01:36,403
Turn Friend Mode on in each app you use:

35
00:01:36,528 --> 00:01:37,565
the TV app,

36
00:01:37,703 --> 00:01:39,615
the phone app and the desktop app.

37
00:01:40,802 --> 00:01:41,489
That's it!

38
00:01:42,214 --> 00:01:45,339
Ask the app's owner for your Friend key, and enjoy.
